      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this particular case it\u0027s to match the behavior of the initial code. Before we were using `CreateDevice` which is a synchronous operation. In native, currently, if you specify `AllowSpontaneous` for `RequestAdapter` and `RequestDevice`, the callback will happen synchronously, however, if you use `AllowProcessEvents` you need to explicitly call `Instance::ProcessEvents` somewhere in order to make the callback happen.",
